Nell dusts flour from her apron. "A warm loaf travels better than an empty stomach."
+ [Tell me about your bread.]
    "A loaf restores 20 Stamina. It costs five gold, and you can keep up to 99 in one stack. Eating it is your choice; buying it won't fill you up."
    -> END
+ [Buy one loaf for 5 gold. # action:bread]
    "Fresh from the oven. I've wrapped it for the road."
    -> END
+ [Where should I prepare for Alby?]
    "Odd sells potions south of the square. Bram can mend a worn weapon. Then follow the northern road to Aren."
    -> END
